  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Buoyoncy = force on base-force on slant surface (f<sub>​y</sub>)<br /><br />Force on slant surface = force on base-buoyancy<br /><br />Force on slant surface = <math> <mrow> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/KT0000225_AnsExp4_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 142px; height: 221px;\" /><br /><br />Force on slant surface = <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
